OL,3,GNEWSAAI meme complaint upheld against  
OL,4,Apolice boss                            
OL,6,FA complaint about an AI meme posted by 
OL,7,Fa police and crime commissioner on     
OL,8,Fsocial media has been upheld.          
OL,10,FRupert Matthews was referred to the the
OL,11,FIndependent Office for Police Conduct  
OL,12,F(IOPC) relating to an allegation that a
OL,13,Fmeme shared on social media may have   
OL,14,Fbeen a racial hate crime.              
OL,16,FThe IOPC concluded there was "no       
OL,17,Findication" the Leicestershire Police  
OL,18,Fand Crime Commissioner had committed a 
OL,19,Fcriminal offence and returned the      
OL,20,Fmatter to a police and crime panel     
OL,21,Fcomplaints committee, which published  
OL,22,Fits findings on Friday.                
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
